  "novel_mechanics_found": "Live confirmation of round 9's source-grounded mechanism: after driving the bare C-structure four control positions left, the wide 8-bar polymorphically latched the separate long bridge rather than the big 8-ring. The latch produced a 48-cell live frame diff, and every subsequent bridge-control move produced 88- or 168-cell composite diffs. Transporting it RIGHT5, UP3, LEFT2, UP3 created a walkable connection from R1 into the goal room.",
  "narrative": "The mandatory precondition passed from a fresh env.reset(): resolve_replay_plan({game: dc22, levels_reproduced: 5}, Path('.')) returned the 322-label banked artifact, whose live replay ended with frame_level(frame)==5 and player (28,52). In that same live environment, round 7's proven L6 re-tooling segment reached the R2 socket at action 448, then its corrected R2-to-LM shelf route reached the LM checker at (18,48) at action 483. Three quad clicks selected 9/A and big-6 teleported to the launcher at (34,58). From the launcher, stepping left lit the C control; four left-control clicks moved the bare C-structure, and the wide 8-bar click visibly latched the long bridge. The attached composite was transported RIGHT5, UP3, LEFT2, UP3. Two parity-balanced teleports then returned launcher to LM and sent LM to R1 after retyping LM from 9/A to C/B. From R1 at (4,4), DOWN2, EAST14, NORTH1, EAST7 reached the goal at (46,6); the live frame advanced to levels_completed=6 and GameState.WIN at candidate action 544. A second fresh env.reset() independently replayed all 544 labels and again ended at level 6, GameState.WIN, player (46,6). Total env.step calls were 544 for discovery/execution plus 544 for reproduction, 1088 aggregate.",
  "gotchas": [
    "R2 cannot reach R1's C/B checker directly north: the corrected route must descend from R2, shelf-ride east to LM, and use the checker teleport network.",
    "At LM, three remote quad clicks are required to select 9/A from 6/7; after returning from the launcher, three more advance 9/A through 6/7 and D/8 to C/B.",
    "The launcher D-pad is enabled by standing on its matching dithered exit: left at (32,58), right at (36,58), and up at (34,56).",
    "The bridge latch is visually distinguishable live: bare C moves changed about 38-40 cells, the latch changed 48 cells, horizontal attached moves changed about 88 cells, and vertical attached moves changed about 168 cells.",
    "The two big-6 teleports after bridge placement temporarily rotate and then restore the attached structure; preserve this even parity before walking the bridge.",
    "ACTION5 was never used. No fail-timer death or RESET recovery was needed in the winning trajectory."
  ],
